# Client-side (Vite) env vars for the demo-tenant cloud baseline feature.
# Must be VITE_-prefixed to be embedded in the built JS bundle. Set the real
# values as Cloudflare Pages build environment variables for the
# tuvara.glocalunit.com project — never commit an actual .env file (already
# gitignored).
#
# From the tuvara-demo Supabase project (Project Settings > API) — the
# ANON/public key only, never the service_role key.
VITE_DEMO_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_DEMO_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Not read by Vite/the client bundle — these are separate, server-side
# concerns and are set elsewhere, never in this file:
#   - DEMO_AUTH_USER / DEMO_AUTH_PASS, APP_AUTH_USER / APP_AUTH_PASS,
#     DEMO_ADMIN_USER / DEMO_ADMIN_PASS: Cloudflare Pages Functions env
#     vars read by functions/_middleware.js (Basic Auth gates).
#   - SEED_SUPABASE_URL / SEED_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY: passed on the
#     command line only when running scripts/seedDemoData.ts once, locally.
